  "solution": {
    "text": "The weight of bucket when it has been pulled up a distance <math><mi>x</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>(5-0.2<math><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />Hence, the required work is<br /><br /><math><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>600&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>"
